{"about_the_game":"<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/b8e3ab1773aa544db73848e207cec920.poster.avif?t=1753681347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/b8e3ab1773aa544db73848e207cec920.webm?t=1753681347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/b8e3ab1773aa544db73848e207cec920.mp4?t=1753681347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Brutal orcs have taken over the resort city.<br>As a chosen bikini warrior, you have decided to fight the orcs and liberate the city.<br>Eliminate all orcs around you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simple, yet incredibly exhilarating action</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/f1a366fe903194a8880f0f4d1b8518f5.poster.avif?t=1753681347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/f1a366fe903194a8880f0f4d1b8518f5.webm?t=1753681347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/f1a366fe903194a8880f0f4d1b8518f5.mp4?t=1753681347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The game controls and system are very simple and easy to learn.<br>However, the exhilarating action that responds to player input immerses you in fierce brawls with the orcs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Perfect Guard System</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/81c8bef5caa4f75cb0c823ab810ba9f3.poster.avif?t=1753681347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/81c8bef5caa4f75cb0c823ab810ba9f3.webm?t=1753681347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/81c8bef5caa4f75cb0c823ab810ba9f3.mp4?t=1753681347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Successfully guard just before the enemy's attack to trigger a Perfect Guard!<br> Reduce incoming damage and seize a powerful counterattack opportunity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fatal Finish! </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/0c1a159303fba58419a8e202d1050d33.poster.avif?t=1753681347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/0c1a159303fba58419a8e202d1050d33.webm?t=1753681347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/0c1a159303fba58419a8e202d1050d33.mp4?t=1753681347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Drive the orcs into a corner and finish them with a Fatal Finish!<br>Land an overwhelming blow, recover your health, and feel refreshed!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And the truth of the resort city is revealed</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/cb508512cf7f654452a55287128d1fdf.avif?t=1753681347\" /></div><br>Defeat the orcs and progress through the story to uncover the secret behind the resort city occupied by them.<br>Why did the orcs take over this city?<br><br>Experience the ultimate in hot and wild bikini action.<br>Now, let\u2019s go kill some orcs!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3829570?t=1753681347","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3829570?t=1753681347","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it